OL,3,AMan rescued after car crashes into
OL,4,Ahouse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man had to be rescued by firefighters
OL,7,Ffrom a house that partially collapsed
OL,8,Fafter a car crashed into it.
OL,10,FPolice officers, paramedics and
OL,11,Ffirefighters were called to the
OL,12,Fproperty on Ninefields, in Waltham
OL,13,FAbbey, Essex shortly before 23:00 BST
OL,14,Fon Friday.
OL,16,FUpon arrival, they found a silver
OL,17,FSkoda, which had smoke coming out of
OL,18,Fit, that had smashed into the corner of
OL,19,Fa house, leaving it badly damaged.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
